{"articleNo":"2360","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2360&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009 안동대 겨울계절수업 수학 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.12","hit":"14060","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청원(2009).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2360&attachNo=1703"},{"name":"2009 안동대 겨울계절수업 수업시간표.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2360&attachNo=2695"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <font size=\"5\">2009&nbsp; 안동대학교 겨울계절수업 수학 안내<br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수업기간 : 2009. 12. 21(월) - 2010. 1. 12(화) &lt;3주간&gt;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 수업시간표 : 붙임 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수강학점 : 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 수강료 : 학점당 35,000원.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 단, 영어, 컴퓨터, 예능계 교과목은 시간당 35,000원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【 시간당 강좌 : 초급영어회화Ⅰ,초급영어회화Ⅱ,컴퓨터기초 】</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">5. 수학 희망신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 지원자격 : 본교와 학점인정교류협정 체결 대학의 재학생으로서 소속 대학 총장의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">추천을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청기간 및 수강료 납부 : : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">. 11. 18(수)까지</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp; 소속 학부행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 수강신청 : 추천서류에 의거 안동대학교 학사관리과에서 일괄 신청.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 학번부여 예정일 : 2009. 11. 26(목) 학생 소속 대학에서 확인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff6600\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#ff0000\">다. 신청유의사항 :&nbsp; 선수과목 해당 교과목여부 확인 후 신청<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ( * 8학기차(편입학생 4학기차) 등록생은 수강신청 불가) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 교과목 폐강</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 수강인원이 10명 미만일 경우 폐강함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;★ 폐강과목은</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 2009.12.09(수)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 안동대학교 홈페이지에 공지할 예정임.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 폐강된 경우 수강료를 반환함 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(폐강된 경우 외에는 수강료를 반환하지 않음)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">7. 학점 및 성적 처리 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학생이 취득한 성적은 본교 학칙, 학사운영규정에 의하여 처리한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 교과이수 단위는 학점으로 하며, 강의는 15시간 이상 수업을 1학점으로 하고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;실험․실습․실기는 30시간 이상의 수업을 1학점으로 한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 성적통보시 학업성적은 100점 만점에 해당등급 환산점수를 표기하여 통보한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 성적통보일 : 2010.01.22(금)예정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 종합학사행정실 : 테크노관 478-7358/&nbsp; 디지털관 478-7751 / 글로벌관 478-7598 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※&nbsp; 안동대학교 학사관리과로 연락바랍니다.(☏ 054-820-7036)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
